  "sourceTitle": "Asian Salsa",
  "sourceText": "Asian Salsa\nBy: Kevin Tu\nPublished: Friday, December 10, 2010 - 1:02am\n\nIngredients\n\n\n\n\n4 lrg Vine ripened tomatoes (diced)\n1 tablespoon Sesame seed oil\n1 tablespoon Extra virgin olive oil\n1 Chopped Thai chili pepper\n2 tablespoons Chopped fresh cilantro\n1 tablespoon Chopped scallions\n2 tablespoons Chopped red onions\n1 tablespoon Oyster sauce\n1/2 tablespoon Dark soy sauce\n\nPreparation\n\n1 Mix all ingredients together. Season to taste with salt and pepper. Chill 1/2 hour before serving. 2 Yield: 4 servings",
